#: src/appdata/org.gnome.Calendar.metainfo.xml.in.in:14
msgid "Manage your schedule"
msgstr "Whakahaerea tō hōtaka"

#: src/appdata/org.gnome.Calendar.metainfo.xml.in.in:17
msgid ""
"GNOME Calendar is an elegant tool to help you plan and stay on top of your "
"schedule for upcoming days and weeks, whether your months are filled with "
"meetings and appointments, public events, travel logistics, or other "
"commitments in your life."
msgstr ""
"He taputapu ātaahua a GNOME Calendar hei āwhina i a koe ki te whakamahere, "
"ki te aroturuki hoki i tō hōtaka mō ngā rā me ngā wiki e tū mai nei, ahakoa "
"kī tonu ō marama i ngā hui, i ngā whakaritenga, i ngā takunetanga tūmatanui, "
"i ngā whakariterite haerenga, i ētahi atu herenga rānei o tō ao."

#: src/appdata/org.gnome.Calendar.metainfo.xml.in.in:22
msgid ""
"Easily create and manage unlimited calendars and events with GNOME "
"Calendar's infinite scrolling month view, week timetable, and scheduling "
"list view."
msgstr ""
"Māmā noa te waihanga me te whakahaere i ngā maramataka me ngā takunetanga "
"mutunga kore, mā te tirohanga marama panuku mutunga kore, te wātaka wiki, me "
"te tirohanga rārangi hōtaka a GNOME Calendar."

#: src/appdata/org.gnome.Calendar.metainfo.xml.in.in:26
msgid ""
"Integrating the latest GNOME technologies and design best practices, GNOME "
"Calendar builds on top of the mature Evolution data server to manage large "
"quantities of events and to provide integration with other applications. You "
"can add calendars from various online calendaring services (like NextCloud, "
"Google Calendar, and CalDAV / WebDAV servers), enabling you to synchronize "
"your events across multiple devices and platforms. GNOME Calendar also "
"supports local and offline calendaring, so you can use it anywhere and "
"anytime while travelling (or after civilization's collapse.)"
msgstr ""
"Mā te whakakotahi i ngā hangarau hōu a GNOME me ngā tikanga hoahoa pai rawa, "
"ka hangaia a GNOME Calendar ki runga i te tūmau raraunga Evolution kua "
"pakeke, hei whakahaere i ngā takunetanga maha, hei tuhono hoki ki ētahi atu "
"taupānga. Ka taea e koe te tāpiri maramataka mai i ngā ratonga maramataka "
"ipurangi (pēnei i a NextCloud, Google Calendar, me ngā tūmau CalDAV / "
"WebDAV), kia taea ai e koe te tukutahi i ō takunetanga puta noa i ngā pūrere "
"me ngā pūhara maha. Ka tautoko anō a GNOME Calendar i te maramataka ā-rohe "
"me te maramataka tuimotu, nō reira ka taea e koe te whakamahi i ngā wāhi "
"katoa, i ngā wā katoa, i a koe e haere ana (i muri rānei i te hinganga o te "
"ao tangata.)"

